{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38219","headline":"嬾起 · 韩偓","name":"嬾起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百舌唤朝眠，春心动几般。\n枕痕霞黯澹，泪粉玉阑珊。\n笼绣香烟歇，屏山烛焰残。\n煖嫌罗韤窄，瘦觉锦衣宽。\n昨夜三更雨，今朝一阵寒。\n海棠花在否，侧卧卷帘看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}